WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.729
There is a runway.

2
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:20.041
I see small planes.

3
00:00:20.042 --> 00:00:28.365
There is a pilot.

4
00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:36.671
I see a tall tower.

5
00:00:36.672 --> 00:00:45.024
There are fast jets.

6
00:00:45.025 --> 00:00:53.369
I see passengers.

7
00:00:53.370 --> 00:01:01.175
There is some luggage.

8
00:01:01.176 --> 00:01:08.423
Where am I?

9
00:01:08.424 --> 00:01:17.057
I am at an airport.

